p, you\u2019ll use strategy, timing, and rhythm to defend the beat that keeps the planet alive.\n\nBuild and upgrade musical towers that double as weaponised instruments. Each Rhythm Tower you place adds a new layer to a dynamic, evolving soundtrack, changing both the music and the flow of battle. Match the rhythm to power up your defences, trigger stronger attacks, and outplay the rhythm-hating Creeps.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/rhythm-towers", "videos": [{"id": 179762, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "jRWvHv9io9Q"}]}